        "id": "33cdc",
        "name": "AC Slater & Curbi - Crave The Bassline",
        "description": "Ayyye fun bassline basshouse dancey pattern map !! Kinda tech,  kinda flowy, hopefully pretty fun :)\r\n\r\nThis song is sick and I had a cool idea for the ex+ drop there that turned out to be pretty fun, it felt like this was gonna sit in WIP forever unless I just blasted out a downmap (which I did because ex+ is a bit tough) so I'm glad I pushed through to get it done and out! \r\n\r\nEx+ : 6.8nps, 19njs, 18.8jd, Star est- 6.9*?? Beware the palm up :)\r\nExpert: 5.2nps, 16njs. 18.7jd, Star est-  4.2*?? This downmap was a bit rushed hope its okee\r\n\r\nFeedbacks to fentonvr on discord thankuuu <3 ",
