        "name": "HYO (효연)  - DEEP",
        "description": "I fell *deep* in love with this song. This map uses Chroma!\n\nThanks to Achrisnic for playtesting and giving feedback.\nMap preview: https://youtu.be/P78_I9ofwKk\n\nIf you have feedback or questions you can contact me on discord: minsiii#0007\nFor more kpop maps go to the kpop beat saber discord: https://discord.gg/c9uHGYP",
