        "name": "Daten (TV Size) [Call of the Night/Yofukashi no Uta Opening] - Creepy Nuts",
        "description": "---------Map uses the new 1.20 Note mechanics (eg: arch and chains) and won't work on any versions of Beat Saber below 1.20---------\n\nGameplay preview: \nhttps://youtu.be/b4D6wDUumxk\n\nSpecial thanks to @pixelboom for the lights!\n\nBoth @pixelboom and @cat-using-a-toaster have their own Expert plus guest difs on the map!\n\nThe difficulties are as follows:\nEasy: Joe's Hard\nNormal: Joe's Expert\nHard: Cat's Expert plus\nExpert: Pixel's Expert plus\nExpert plus: Joe's Expert plus\n\nDaten (堕だ天てん) performed by Creepy Nuts is the opening theme for the Call of the Night anime.",
