        "description": "---------Map uses the new 1.20 Note mechanics (eg: arch and chains) and won't work on any versions of Beat Saber below 1.20---------\n\nMap and custom platform preview:  https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oPt1k2ax46E\n\nDownload the custom platform here: https://drive.google.com/file/d/1s3GHsjnacX_EH43EFiO8z8Q8ev4fu7KZ/view?usp=sharing\n\nTry this map out with the custom platform! It adds the dancers from project sekai into the game!\n\nPlatform will not be in sync with the Auto Pause Stealth mod installed as it pauses the game at the start of the map. (or you can just disable camera 2 to see it)\n\nThe platform has a camera override that overrides the main screen, it won't show up by default with the camera 2 mod installed but it's a layer at the very bottom.",
