        "description": "Part of the Kaskade \"Reset\" EP! Very comfy fun dance map to chew on. Yet again another personal experiment to widen my dance mapping knowledge.\n\nThis map contains a chroma lightshow, be sure to have chroma installed and enabled for the full experience!\n\nDifficulties: Normal, Hard, Expert, Expert+, One Saber Expert+\nLength: 3:20\nBPM: 125\nStandard: Normal = 1.5, Hard = 2.2, Expert = 3, Expert+ = 3.5\nOne Saber: Expert+ = 2.3\n\nSpecial thanks to @Dee-Dee for testplaying the map during it's WIP Phase!\n\nIf you have any feedback about this map (Positive / Negative) then feel free to reach out to me on discord! Phøenix#5713",
