        "name": "[Chroma] Ardolf x Hyprzal - BAD x END",
        "description": "REUP #1: Official first Big V & lil V collab!?\nREUP #2: Shrado mod some changes to all diffs and timings fixes!!!\nREUP #3: Now fullspread thanks to voltage doing two lowers 🤩\nREUP #4: Voltage had offtime notes...\nREUP #5: Metadata inconsistency \nREUP #6: More timing changes AHHH\n\nif you're playing with lights don't forget to use the environment: Timbaland\n\nme and @VoltageO cooked up a pretty savage groove officially now for rank\ni would say thanks for the guest diff but shit took 3 months... \nanyways i hope you nasty pp farmers enjoy!\n\nif you like the map or want to share any feedback let me know down below or through my discord | notvoidless\n\ncheck out ardolf and hyprzal here!!\nhttps://soundcloud.com/ardolf_music\nhttps://soundcloud.com/user-406395354\n\nStar estimate\n@VoltageO diff | 10.75 🌟\n@Voidless diff | 10.5 🌟\n\nGLHF!!! EXPECT REUPS",
